  "instructions": [
    "Combine sour cream, chopped red onion, diced fresh dill, and salt-free seasoning blend in a bowl.",
    "Stir in lemon juice and sour pickle juice until well combined.",
    "Place hot smoked flaked salmon in a separate bowl.",
    "Warm the salmon in a sous-vide water bath at 130°F (54°C) for 10 minutes.",
    "Remove the salmon from the water bath and top with the sour cream mixture.",
    "Dot the top with unsalted butter.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy!"
